  "_id": "LXGEXzRWHJdHkyGP",
  "name": "Remade",
  "type": "biological",
  "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>The remade are completely redesigned: humans 2.0. Their cardiovascular system is stronger, their digestive tract sanitized and restructured, and they have been optimized for health, intelligence, and longevity with numerous transgenic mods. They look close to human, but are different in very noticeable and sometimes eerie ways: taller, lack of hair, slightly larger craniums, wider eyes, smaller noses, smaller teeth, and elongated digits. The remade are popular with the Ultimates faction.</p>",
    "reference": "Eclipse Phase Second Edition p. 57",
